"platform": 6, "y": 2008, "release_region": {"id": 1, "region": "europe"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 45607, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/rpt84prbmsjp4uzgawb6.jpg"}, {"id": 45609, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/u7ntjmcgrglu6d7qr2ii.jpg"}, {"id": 45610, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/cxn6azrcudit63r67o8p.jpg"}, {"id": 45611, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/b1kc5umsekcr848ympw8.jpg"}, {"id": 45608, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/irpwkcjify8xggbaosqv.jpg"}], "slug": "s-dot-t-a-dot-l-k-dot-e-r-dot-clear-sky", "storyline": "A prequel to S.T.A.L.K.E.R.: Shadow of Chernobyl, Clear Sky returns to the Zone, the perilous forbidden territory surrounding the Chernobyl Nuclear Power Plant, where mutants, deadly anomalies, and roving factions of scavengers known as Stalkers vie for survival and the priceless artifacts the region produces. The player takes on the role of Scar, a hardened mercenary who survives a catastrophic emission of lethal energy and is taken in by the scientific faction called Clear Sky. Aligned with this group, Scar is given a dangerous task: to track and stop a band of Stalkers pushing ever deeper toward the heart of the Zone, an incursion that threatens to destabilize the fragile balance of the entire region. As he ventures through hazardous swamps, ruined settlements, and contested battlegrounds, Scar becomes entangled in the ongoing faction wars that grip the Zone. His pursuit gradually centers on a single elusive figure, the Stalker Strelok, whose actions lie at the core of the unfolding crisis.", "summary": "Year 2011. Five years passed since the Second Disaster, which eclipsed the events of April 1986. The Zone is shaken by frequent and powerful blowouts, which move anomaly fields, opening new routes to previously inaccessible locations. Stalker factions fight for the new territories and key points. A lot of stalkers die, but newbies keep on arriving.\n\nThe action takes place one year prior to the events of S.T.A.L.K.E.R.: Shadow of Chernobyl, one year before Strelok's most successful trip to the center of the Zone \u2013 the third one. You will learn about Strelok and his squad from another character's vantage point.\n\nThe Zone is waiting for you ahead, new locations and unknown threats, spatial holes and monsters hiding in the fog, pitch-black nights and saving rays of a rising sun. Try to avoid anomalies and hide from blowouts, discover the Zone and collect artifacts, cure radioactive irradiation and fight for any stalker faction you like! Only then you will uncover the truth about Strelok and how he happened to get inside the death truck and receive the S.T.A.L.K.E.R. tattoo on his arm.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}, {"id": 23, "name": "Stealth"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/s-dot-t-a-dot-l-k-dot-e-r-dot-clear-sky", "videos": [{"id": 28713, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "pM93lfC37T4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pM93lfC37T4", "title": "S.T.A.L.K.E.R.: Clear Sky | Trailer [GOG]", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/pM93lfC37T4/hqdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 1039, "name": "S.T.A.L.K.E.R."}]}